{"channelId":"UCiT5rdhU3rIBtYL0iDTNpNw","row":["Pediatric Epilepsy Surgery Alliance",2420,"Our mission is to enhance the lives of children who need neurosurgery to treat their seizures. We do this through our impactful programs, services, and research before, during, and after surgery.\n\nInfo + Resources: Our website contains information, downloadable guides, videos, and evidence-based knowledge to help you navigate your child's epilepsy surgery journey. \n\nParent Support Navigator Program: Our support navigators are trained in evidence-based peer support practices. They speak English, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Farsi, Hindi, and Malay Indonesian.\n\nSurgical Evaluation Travel Scholarship: Up to $1,000 in reimbursed travel costs for families who seek an epilepsy surgery evaluation for their child more than 50 miles from home.\n\nSchool Training: We help school teams understand your child's strengths and challenges. after epilepsy surgery.\n\nwww.epilepsysurgeryalliance.org\n\nFacebook: @PESAlliance\nInstagram: @pedsepilepsysurgeryalliance\nTwitter: @PESAlliance","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiT5rdhU3rIBtYL0iDTNpNw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiT5rdhU3rIBtYL0iDTNpNw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:18.387Z","channelId":"UCiT5rdhU3rIBtYL0iDTNpNw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"dfd4b446b87649d3a76a7ce342060bcf16a5fb788ba7a012b3695b070421a878","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"176adf1e8debb499f03d26b5a94f65e2284fe0acae410e030ff860e9cc74e0f0"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiT5rdhU3rIBtYL0iDTNpNw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:18.387Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiT5rdhU3rIBtYL0iDTNpNw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2420,"raw":"2.42K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiT5rdhU3rIBtYL0iDTNpNw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:2